    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f259e39530cdc45c955e0fc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我和乙名史记者共同分享喜悦，\n听她诉说对“闪耀明星巅峰赛”的\n深厚情感。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3eacac803fb6fa337c16551ab65e75cd64a882a724b7b64c99785e239b9575c1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
