      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我希望她能看见真正厉害的赛马娘\n证明自己实力的瞬间──",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb8f9d2fe2fe3e7554b14b0555b4d2cf7cb3753d6c7092c8ba6ec9310ba0c367",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0004/storytimeline_400004405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed8e8f568e9c0330b4b4d079",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我想证明<chrname>就是最强的赛马娘，\n此时这想法又更加强烈了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d3d5f8954bf6e4539d0c0e577e9fb79dcef1fd6bb6f16096ad1cab0ec4515b8d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
